# The engine's base content: what a game has before it has anything of its
# own. Packed into base.vault by scripts/build-content.sh and compiled into
# every game (see src/base.rs). One virtual path per line; a directory ends
# in `/` and takes everything under it. A game's own files override these.

# The developer and tool textures every map may use, decals and the stock
# props' materials.
materials/
models/props/

# Sounds, and the table that names them.
sound/
scripts/kerosene.kerosnd

# The default HUD, pause menu, panels and overlays.
ui/

# The demo map and its script: what a project with no start map opens on.
maps/kero_start.kerobsp
maps/kero_start.kerowalk
scripts/kero_start.keroscript
